  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the following:\n\n(a) The administrative requirements to implement the blue envelope program. The blue envelope program provides law enforcement officers documentation to facilitate communication during an interaction with licensed drivers diagnosed with autism spectrum or trauma and stressor-related disorders or both;\n\n(b) The procedure for requesting a blue envelope;\n\n(c) The acceptable forms of proof of an autism spectrum or trauma and stressor-related disorders to obtain a blue envelope;\n\n(d) The handling of confidential medical information;\n\n(e) The content and format of the blue envelope; and\n\n(f) The requirement to attach the blue envelope to the visor;\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8500.html"
